OL,3,GNEWSATom Cruise surprises fundraiser at
OL,4,Afake interview
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who has dedicated his life to
OL,7,Fraising money for children with
OL,8,Flife-limiting conditions was left
OL,9,Fstunned when Tom Cruise walked in
OL,10,Fduring a fake interview.
OL,12,FLloyd Kembrey, 30, from Bristol,
OL,13,Ftravelled to London believing he was
OL,14,Ffilming a documentary about
OL,15,Ffundraising, only to be surprised by
OL,16,Fthe actor, who congratulated him on his
OL,17,Fextreme fundraising challenges.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
