OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSATom Cruise surprises fundraiser at
OL,4,Afake interview
OL,5,
OL,6,FCruise said at the meeting, which was
OL,7,Fstaged by the One Show: "I'm here to
OL,8,Fgive you one big thank you. I've done a
OL,9,Flot of wild things and stunts, but when
OL,10,FI heard about [his] adventure, I just
OL,11,Fthought, I gotta meet this guy."
OL,13,FKembrey, who raises money for charity
OL,14,FJessie May, added: "I couldn't believe
OL,15,Fit. I'm just really grateful."
